    rdfs:comment "Real full title and dates confirmed 2026-08-13 via independent web search (issued Jul 17 2024, recorded Jun 27 2024) — URL and full transcript content still not independently verified/fleshed out."@en ;
    dct:created "2024-06-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:issued "2024-07-17"^^xsd:date ;
    thinkr:hasHost tgs:Persona.NateHagens ;
    thinkr:hasGuest tgs:Persona.DanielSchmachtenberger ;
    dct:references tgs:Interview.TGS_126_AVisionForBetterment ;
    skos:scopeNote "CORRECTED 2026-08-13 — the previously-flagged 'candidate replay link' (youtu.be/_P8PLHvZygo) is likely a misattribution, not this episode's own real replay: that URL's own real title is 'Artificial Intelligence and The Superorganism,' matching tgs:Interview.TGS_71_ArtificialIntelligenceAndTheSuperorganism (May 2023, not yet built), not this episode's own real title ('Silicon Dreams and Carbon Nightmares'). Real, confirmed cross-reference instead, found while building TGS_126: this episode's own real show notes directly cite TGS_126 at timestamp 1:45:22 — dct:references added accordingly."@en .

