# ADDED 2026-08-13 — RR-26 Tier 1 enrichment: real cross-referenced
# episodes surfaced via its own real linked show notes, resolving 2
# gaps already flagged as deferred (RR-19, RR-10) plus 4 genuinely new
# real finds. All genuinely minimal stubs — real number/title/URL only,
# nothing invented.
